#. ~ Profession (male Awakening Psion) description
#: ./professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You survived a portal storm and hid inside while reality broke around you, "
"and when you left to examine the damage you found a strange crystal the "
"storm had left behind.  It was captivating, and you took it with you.  "
"Sometimes, at night, you look into it before you sleep, and you almost feel "
"like something in you is responding to the glow within the crystal."
msgstr ""

