msgid "Challenge - Heart of Fire"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Scenario description for 'challenge_scen_firestarter'
#: ./scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You always loved setting fires as a child, sometimes spending hours just "
"watching the flames.  That fire awakened in you during the Cataclysm, "
"powerful and almost uncontrollable.  You can call up flames from thin air, "
"burn zombies to ash with a thought, surround yourself in a blazing inferno, "
"but the fire demands release.  It's like a internal pressure, growing as "
"long as you don't use your powers, until it flows out as the flames rise.  "
"Can you survive in the new world without burning yourself to ash?"
msgstr ""

