#: ./furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
msgid ""
"A transporter beacon, placed on the ground with a stable set of coordinates."
"  (e)xamine to finish the setup."
msgstr ""

#: ./furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
msgid "telepathic amplifier"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for telepathic amplifier
#: ./furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
msgid ""
"A bulky machine with a chair and a hat-like mechanism designed to fit over "
"the wearer's head, like something you would find in a hair salon.  You have "
"no idea how to operate it, but you could scavenge it for parts."
msgstr ""

#: ./furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
msgid "SHADOW URGE nexus"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for SHADOW URGE nexus
#: ./furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
msgid ""
"A bulky machine with a chair and an array of straps, with various tanks "
"connected to IVs on the back and several computers connected by wires.  It "
"looks extremely sinister."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for noetic resonance detector
#: ./furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
msgid ""
"A table and chair topped with what looks like something you'd seen in an "
"optometrist's office for testing vision, except this also has a headband and"
" an armband hanging off the side connected to the main apparatus by cables."
"  There is a full-sized keyboard and several dials on the opposite side from"
" the chair where the subject is supposed to sit; without a set of "
"instructions, you'd have no idea how to operate this."
msgstr ""

#: ./furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
msgid "portal stabilizer"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for portal stabilizer
#: ./furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
msgid ""
"A strange machine that looks a little like a large gyroscope.  Multiple "
"concentric rings are built around a central matrix crystal, all connected to"
" an antenna.  How it was used is unclear, since there doesn't seem to be a "
"keyboard or any input device."
msgstr ""

#: ./furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
msgid "glowing crystal"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for glowing crystal
#: ./furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
msgid ""
"An irregular chunk of glowing crystal.  The fitful glow sheds no "
"illumination on the nearby terrain."
msgstr ""

#: ./furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
msgid "the glowing crystal shatter!"
msgstr ""

#: ./furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
msgid "a hard, ringing clonk as the crystal holds!"
msgstr ""

#: ./furniture_and_terrain/mom_graffiti.json
msgid "scrawled message"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for scrawled message
#: ./furniture_and_terrain/mom_graffiti.json
msgid "Words left behind by some earlier survivor.  Examine it to read them."
msgstr ""

#: ./furniture_and_terrain/psi_enclave.json
msgid "chalk circle"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for chalk circle
#: ./furniture_and_terrain/psi_enclave.json
msgid ""
"A careful circle of chalk on the steel deck of the old truck scale, about a "
"stride across, with a number written beside it.  Someone keeps it swept and "
"redrawn.  You get the feeling you shouldn't be standing in it."
msgstr ""

#: ./furniture_and_terrain/psi_enclave.json
msgid "tally board"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for tally board
#: ./furniture_and_terrain/psi_enclave.json
msgid ""
"A whiteboard on a wheeled stand, ruled into columns in marker.  The heading "
"reads EATS OF THE WEEK.  Examine it to read the standings."
msgstr ""

#: ./furniture_and_terrain/psi_enclave.json
msgid "clatter!"
msgstr ""

#: ./furniture_and_terrain/psi_enclave.json
msgid "whump."
msgstr ""

#: ./furniture_and_terrain/psi_enclave.json
msgid "pinned road map"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for pinned road map
#: ./furniture_and_terrain/psi_enclave.json
msgid ""
"A road map of New England, gone soft from handling and shingled with sticky "
"notes.  Red pins: hordes, each with a date.  Blue pins: crystals, most of "
"them crossed out.  Green pins are rarer, and each one has an index card "
"tacked beside it.  A few of the pins have been painted black.  Examine it to"
" read the cards."
msgstr ""

#: ./furniture_and_terrain/psi_enclave.json
msgid "stack of granite blocks"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for stack of granite blocks
#: ./furniture_and_terrain/psi_enclave.json
msgid ""
"Rough-cut granite blocks, each the size of a footlocker, stacked with a "
"precision no forklift ever managed.  Leftover quarry stock."
msgstr ""

