"forms of crowd pacification, able to disable a target for up to a minute "
"with a single shot and few to no permanent effects.  While it cannot be said"
" to be nonlethal because it is not safe to use on targets with heart "
"conditions or epilepsy, it is a great improvement over the previous X04 "
"\"Tecuacuilli\" which, on unfortunately not-rare-enough occasions, could "
"cause permanent paralysis.  On this world, though, you don't think the M12's"
" lethality or lack thereof is going to be much of a concern."
