#: ./items/weapons.json
msgid "Onšut §A"
msgid_plural "Onšut §As"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""

#: ./items/weapons.json
msgid ""
"The world where this crowd-control weapon came from made great use of "
"psionic technology, but it wasn't enough to save them from their own "
"Cataclysm.  The Exodii left most devices they found in the ruins, assuming "
"that they would be too difficult to maintain, but took some of the simpler "
"weapons with them.  The Onšut §A overloads the target's mind, trapping them "
"in a hallucinatory waking dream.  This renders them almost completely "
"harmless while in effect, with the unfortunate disadvantage of not affecting"
" zombies."
msgstr ""

