#: ./monsters/zombies.json
msgid ""
"This zombie's limbs are elongated and its torso is stretched, causing it to "
"occasionally drop on all fours to skitter faster than a normal walk.  When "
"you look directly at it, gray static flickers on the edge of your vision and"
" you hear a very low droning hum."
msgstr ""

