"This small, winged predator darts through the air on three thinly-haired "
"wings that look like stretched human hands.  A sheer, jagged spike juts out "
"from the point where the wings meet.  It looks like nothing you've seen on "
"Earth, and yet strangely like it is made of human parts.  As it darts "
"through the air, nearby obstacles sometimes bend slightly away from it."
