#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid "Latent Psion"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Latent Psion'}
#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid ""
"Before the Cataclysm, you were lucky in some way.  Maybe you never lost your"
" keys, or maybe you always made that last green light before getting home, "
"or maybe you never had to take a sick day in your life.  Now after the "
"Cataclysm, you have the potential for even more power.  Your first attempt "
"to awaken psionic powers will always be successful."
msgstr ""

#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid "Introvert"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Introvert'}
#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid ""
"You can tolerate others, but you prefer to be alone.  Spending time by "
"yourself will boost your mood slightly."
msgstr ""

#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid "Loner"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Loner'}
#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid ""
"You'd really rather be by yourself.  Being alone will improve your mood, but"
" spending too much time around other people can grate on your nerves."
msgstr ""

#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid "Efficient System"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Efficient System'}
#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid ""
"Thanks to your powers, you need less food and drink than the average person "
"and are more efficient at processing it."
msgstr ""

#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid "Headblind"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Headblind'}
#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid ""
"You've seen people do some crazy things after the Cataclysm, but you've "
"never managed to figure out how they do it.  You can never learn psionic "
"powers."
msgstr ""

#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid "Psionic Senses"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Psionic Senses'}
#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid ""
"Your powers protect you from some sensory disruption and allow you to detect"
" creatures from beyond."
msgstr ""

#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid "Galvanic Armor"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Galvanic Armor'}
#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid ""
"Your powers help protect you from electrical damage and slightly reduce the "
"intensity of pain you feel."
msgstr ""

#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid "Tonallichicahualizmeya"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Tonallichicahualizmeya'}
#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid ""
"You have a matrix in your central nervous system that acts as a universal "
"control and installation bus for compact bionic modules."
msgstr ""

#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid "Fifth Sun People"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Fifth Sun People'}
#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid ""
"You were born in the Ēxcān Tlahtōlōyān, maybe on Tlalticpactli, perhaps even"
" in Anáhuac, or maybe on one of the colony worlds like Demeter or Yathrib or"
" Tài Suì.  You enlisted in the Imperial Navy for your own reasons.  Perhaps "
"you are a scion of the Huey Calpulli following in your ancestors' footsteps,"
" or perhaps you are one of the mācēhualtin seeking the social benefits of a "
"completed tour of military service.  Regardless, now you are here, in the "
"ashes of a dying world, and have to find a way to survive."
msgstr ""

#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid "Forgetful"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Forgetful'}
#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid ""
"You have a hard time remembering things.  Your skills will erode slightly "
"faster than usual, and you have trouble keeping your story straight when "
"lying."
msgstr ""

#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid "Good Memory"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Good Memory'}
#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid ""
"You have an exceptional memory, and find it easy to remember things.  "
"However, you don't benefit as much as other people from dropping a subject "
"for a while and will thus end up learning slower."
msgstr ""

#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid "Hates Books"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Hates Books'}
#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid ""
"Reading is for nerds!  Boring books are more boring, and you can't have fun "
"by reading books."
msgstr ""

#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid "Antsy"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Antsy'}
#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid ""
"You can't bear to stay still for long.  Your morale will suffer unless you "
"constantly explore new territory."
msgstr ""

#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid "Restless"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Restless'}
#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid ""
"Spending any amount of time in familiar places makes you miserable.  Must.  "
"Keep.  Moving."
msgstr ""

#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid "Numb"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Numb'}
#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid "Your ability to feel or express emotion has been greatly hampered."
msgstr ""

#. ~ mutation 'PHOTOLIXIR_LIGHT': transform.msg_transform
#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid "The air around you starts glowing brightly."
msgstr ""

#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid "Golden Radiance"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Golden Radiance'}
#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid "You can make the air around you emit a strong light."
msgstr ""

#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid "Photon Regulation"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Photon Regulation'}
#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid ""
"Your powers passively filter the amount of photons your eyes receive, and "
"amplify what little light there is -- you see well even in near-total "
"darkness."
msgstr ""

#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid "Picky Eater"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Picky Eater'}
#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid ""
"You're a very picky eater.  You refuse to eat any food that tastes bad "
"unless you're starving."
msgstr ""

#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid "Concentration (Beginner)"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Concentration (Beginner)'}
#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid ""
"You are capable of holding the same thing in mind even when sitting in an "
"uncomfortable position or after skipping a meal."
msgstr ""

#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid "Concentration (Expert)"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Concentration (Expert)'}
#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid ""
"You can maintain your concentration even if outside in winter without a coat"
" or while in combat with a zombie."
msgstr ""

#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid "Concentration (Master)"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Concentration (Master)'}
#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid ""
"You can maintain your concentration even when suffering crippling injuries "
"or while on mind-altering substances."
msgstr ""

#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid "Extended Channeling"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Extended Channeling'}
#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid ""
"You can take more time and care in channeling your powers.  It will take 5x "
"as long to evoke them, but it will be much easier to activate them and you "
"will be less likely to gain Nether Attunement while doing so."
msgstr ""

#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid "Torrential Channeling"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Torrential Channeling'}
#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid ""
"You can draw deeply on the Nether, increasing the strength of your powers "
"but making making them harder to initiate and control."
msgstr ""

#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid "Internal Fire"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Internal Fire'}
#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid ""
"You naturally heat the air around you slightly, making it more comfortable "
"in the cold.  It also helps prevent you from getting too wet."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Heart of Fire'}
#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid "The fire in your soul rises and falls, but never truly goes out."
msgstr ""

#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid "Seasonal Affective Disorder"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Seasonal Affective Disorder'}
#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid ""
"You tend to have bouts of depression during the fall and especially winter."
"  Taking antidepressants can help."
msgstr ""

#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid "Extrovert"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Extrovert'}
#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid ""
"You don't mind being alone, but you get a slight mood boost from being "
"around friends."
msgstr ""

#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid "Sociable"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Sociable'}
#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid ""
"You are a social creature.  Spending time with friends will improve your "
"mood, but if you're alone too long, you'll start to feel unhappy."
msgstr ""

#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid "Squeamish"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Squeamish'}
#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid ""
"You can't even think about putting filthy clothes on yourself, especially "
"from zombies' corpses."
msgstr ""

#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid "Strict Humanitarian"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Strict Humanitarian'}
#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid ""
"You're convinced that these things that look vaguely human from elsewhere "
"are definitely not people.  Therefore it's okay to eat them, right?"
msgstr ""

#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid "Rigid Table Manners"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Rigid Table Manners'}
#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid ""
"You've been taught proper table manners from your early childhood on; now, "
"you can't even think about eating without being seated at a table and taking"
" your time.  Eating without a table and chair frustrates you, but eating "
"like a civilized person gives you a bigger morale bonus."
msgstr ""

#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid "Grasping Hand"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Grasping Hand'}
#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid ""
"Thanks to a minor application of telekinesis, the items you want to grab are"
" always quick to hand."
msgstr ""

#. ~ mutation 'TELELIXIRDOWN': transform.msg_transform
#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid "You unleash your powers."
msgstr ""

#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid "Elixir PK Surge"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Elixir PK Surge'}
#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid ""
"Thanks to the crystalline elixir, you can lash out with unfocused surges of "
"telekinetic power."
msgstr ""

#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid "Telepathic Suggestion"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Telepathic Suggestion'}
#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid "You are subtly influencing the minds of the people you speak to."
msgstr ""

#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid "Spacial Recalibration"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Spacial Recalibration'}
#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid ""
"You can keep otherworldly eyes off you to some extent, and you will "
"sometimes instinctively teleport to avoid danger."
msgstr ""

#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid "Truth Teller"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Truth Teller'}
#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid ""
"When you try to tell a lie, you blush, stammer, and get all shifty-eyed.  "
"Telling lies and otherwise bluffing will be much more difficult for you."
msgstr ""

#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid "Highly Vain"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Highly Vain'}
#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid ""
"You know you're beautiful, and the world deserves to know it too.  You "
"prefer to show off your stunningly good looks and will be unhappy if you "
"cover up your face."
msgstr ""

#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid "Vegan"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Vegan'}
#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid ""
"You're very strictly vegan, eating animal products is out of the question, "
"even if it means death.  You also can't bear to wear clothing made of animal"
" products, such as leather or fur."
msgstr ""

#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid "VERDANT HAND Combat Protocols"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'VERDANT HAND Combat Protocols'}
#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid ""
"Who needs weapons?  Thanks to your biokinesis, you deal more melee damage "
"while fighting with your bare hands.  This damage improves as your unarmed "
"skill and biokinetic prowess increase."
msgstr ""

#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid "Awakened Vitakinetic"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Awakened Vitakinetic
#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid "Mental control over health and vitality."
msgstr ""

#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid "Bloom of Vitality"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Bloom of Vitality'}
#: ./mutations/gen_granted_traits.json
msgid ""
"Your psionic powers speed your healing slightly and increase your overall "
"resilience, and any broken limbs you have mend straight and true."
msgstr ""

#: ./mutations/traits.json
msgid "Awakened Biokinetic"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Awakened Biokinetic
#: ./mutations/traits.json
msgid "Mental control over bodily processes."
msgstr ""

#: ./mutations/traits.json
msgid "Awakened Clairsentient"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Awakened Clairsentient
#: ./mutations/traits.json
msgid "The ability to extend the senses beyond the body."
msgstr ""

#: ./mutations/traits.json
msgid "Awakened Electrokinetic"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Awakened Electrokinetic
#: ./mutations/traits.json
msgid "Mental control of lightning and electricity."
msgstr ""

#: ./mutations/traits.json
msgid "Awakened Photokinetic"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Awakened Photokinetic
#: ./mutations/traits.json
msgid "Mental control of visible light and electromagnetic waves."
msgstr ""

#: ./mutations/traits.json
msgid "Awakened Pyrokinetic"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Awakened Pyrokinetic
#: ./mutations/traits.json
msgid "Mental control of heat and flame."
msgstr ""

#: ./mutations/traits.json
msgid "Awakened Telekinetic"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Awakened Telekinetic
#: ./mutations/traits.json
msgid "Mental control over the motion of objects and people at a distance."
msgstr ""

#: ./mutations/traits.json
msgid "Awakened Telepath"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Awakened Telepath
#: ./mutations/traits.json
msgid "The ability to read thoughts and influence others' minds."
msgstr ""

#: ./mutations/traits.json
msgid "Awakened Teleporter"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Awakened Teleporter
#: ./mutations/traits.json
msgid ""
"The ability to move without crossing the intervening space, as well as some "
"control over space itself."
msgstr ""

#: ./mutations/traits.json
msgid "Improved Concentration"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Improved Concentration'}
#: ./mutations/traits.json
msgid ""
"You can keep your mind on something even if there are plenty of "
"distractions.  The number of psionic powers you can maintain at once is "
"increased by 1."
msgstr ""

#: ./mutations/traits.json
msgid "Easily Distracted"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Easily Distracted'}
#: ./mutations/traits.json
msgid ""
"Any day now you're going to buckle down and oh hey is that a butterfly?  The"
" number of psionic powers you can maintain at once is reduced by 1."
msgstr ""

#: ./mutations/traits.json
msgid "Debug Concentration"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Debug Concentration'}
#: ./mutations/traits.json
msgid ""
"You could keep every single bug in the game in mind simultaneously with this"
" one."
msgstr ""

#. ~ mutation 'PHOTOLIXIR_LIGHT_active': transform.msg_transform
#: ./mutations/traits.json
msgid "The air around you loses its radiance."
msgstr ""

#: ./mutations/traits.json
msgid "Golden Radiance (on)"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Golden Radiance (on)'}
#: ./mutations/traits.json
msgid "The air around you is emitting a bright light."
msgstr ""

#. ~ mutation 'TELELIXIRDOWN_active': transform.msg_transform
#: ./mutations/traits.json
msgid "You rein your powers back in for now."
msgstr ""

#: ./mutations/traits.json
msgid "Elixir PK Surge (active)"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Elixir PK Surge (active)'}
#: ./mutations/traits.json
msgid "You are lashing out with your elixir-forged telekinetic powers."
msgstr ""

#: ./mutations/traits.json
msgid "Noetic Flexibility"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Noetic Flexibility'}
#: ./mutations/traits.json
msgid ""
"Your expanded mind is far more capable of understanding Netherum Mathematics"
" than a mere human's.  You have a greater chance of awakening new psionic "
"paths."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "The Psionic Alliance"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for The Psionic Alliance
#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"Awakened psions who found each other in the first weeks of the Cataclysm and"
" dug in at a worked-out granite quarry.  They would rather be left alone, "
"and mostly they are."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Alliance Leader"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "I keep nine frightened people alive and mostly sane."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Pyrokinetic"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "I keep the forge lit.  Usually on purpose."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Telekinetic"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "I build things out of rocks nobody else can lift."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Photokinetic"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "I'm the sun, for a basement full of tomatoes."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Electrokinetic"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "I charge the batteries.  Every day.  By myself."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Clairsentient"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "I watch the map.  Then I watch the world."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Teleporter"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Supply runs.  Long ones.  Very fast."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Biokinetic Medic"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "I knit bone.  I used to do taxes."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Biokinetic"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "I eat.  Then I lift things.  Then I eat."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Constance Hale"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Dana Okafor"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Marcus Bell"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Priya Raman"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Eli Navarro"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Wren Talbot"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Jules Ferreira"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Theo Lindqvist"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Ray Haskins"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Welcome back.  Your mind's quieter than last time.  Good."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"There you are.  Sit, if you like.  Nobody here will ask you to explain "
"yourself."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Back again.  The quarry's glad of you, even if Eli won't say so."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "The one with the spark.  Still not a fire, I see.  Give it time."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "You're back.  Still keeping your thoughts friendly, I hope."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"I heard you coming from the gate.  You think in capital letters, did you "
"know that?  Don't worry.  Most of us did, at first.  I'm Constance.  Welcome"
" to the Alliance.  You're safe here."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"There's a spark in you.  Not a fire, not yet, but I can see it from across "
"the room.  You're welcome to sit by ours.  I'm Constance."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"You're not one of us.  That's all right; we aren't choosy about who we feed."
"  But understand where you're standing.  Everyone in this quarry can do "
"something you can't, and most of them are tired.  Keep your hands to "
"yourself and your thoughts friendly, and there won't be any trouble.  I'm "
"Constance."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Who are you people?"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "What is this place?"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "How did you all find each other?"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Can I rest here?"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "What's in the old magazine up on the rim?"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Could you use your gift to help me with something?"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "I should be going."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"The Psionic Alliance.  It's a grander name than nine frightened people "
"deserve, but it was Eli's idea and he'd sulk.  We all woke up in the first "
"weeks.  Most of us touched a crystal; a couple of us still don't know what "
"happened.  What we have in common is that nobody else understood it, and "
"none of us wanted to go through it alone."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Let's talk about something else."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"A granite quarry, worked out years before any of this.  We chose it because "
"the pit is a wall nothing climbs, the stone is free, and it's quiet.  Quiet "
"matters, when half of us can hear thinking.  The office was the quarry's.  "
"Everything else we built: Marcus stacked the cabins, Dana lit the forge, and"
" Priya grows tomatoes in the basement, which I still can't quite believe."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"Wren found us.  When someone awakens, she feels it, like a match struck in a"
" dark room.  She walked to the first two of us on foot.  Then Jules learned "
"to jump, and things got faster.  We still look.  There's a wall in the map "
"room full of pins, and every green one is somebody who woke up alone."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "What happens to the ones who wake up alone?"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"Some of them figure it out.  Most of them don't, not in time.  You've seen "
"them out there: the ones who set fields on fire, or scream at the sky with "
"lightning on their skin.  That's what it looks like when you go through this"
" with nobody to tell you that you aren't going mad.  So we try to get there "
"first."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"Of course.  There's a free bunk in the south cabins, the mess feeds "
"whoever's here, and the forge is open.  One more thing.  If you ever start "
"to hear a hum you can't place, go down to the pump house at the bottom of "
"the pit and sit.  There are dampeners in the lockers.  Nobody will ask why."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"You can rest here.  Eat in the mess, sleep by the stove, use the forge.  Ask"
" first, and don't take what isn't offered.  Two more rules: stay out of the "
"pit, and stay away from the magazine on the rim."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Thanks.  I should be going."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"Crystals.  The thing that did this to us, in raw form.  That magazine used "
"to hold blasting caps, and it's about the right amount of respect.  It's "
"locked, there is no key, and that's the end of it."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "And if I wanted one?"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"Then you'd be the third person to ask this month, and the answer hasn't "
"changed.  We've seen what those stones do to people who aren't ready.  "
"Sometimes to people who are.  Please don't make me have this conversation a "
"second time."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Understood."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"Constance.  The office at the end of the road; her room is through the map "
"room.  She'll know you're coming before you knock.  Don't let it bother you."
"  It bothers everyone at first."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Thanks."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "The forge is lit.  It's always lit.  You're welcome to use it."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"Mind the anvil, it's hot.  No, I didn't heat it.  Well.  Not on purpose."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"New face.  If you're looking for whoever's in charge, that's Constance, in "
"the office up the road.  Go and see her before you touch anything.  "
"Especially the forge."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Where do I find Constance?"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Why is the charcoal only for guests?"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "See you around."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"Because I'm the charcoal.  A month ago that would've been a joke.  Now "
"things catch fire when I get annoyed at them.  You've seen the shed out on "
"the range?  That was a Tuesday.  I'm much better now.  Mostly."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Good to know."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"Need something moved?  Everything weighs about the same to me now.  Weird "
"thing to know about yourself."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"One more cabin and we can stop doubling up.  Well.  One more cabin and one "
"more roof."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"*sets down a granite block the size of a footlocker without touching it.*  "
"Hi.  You'll want Constance.  The office, up the road."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Did you build all this?"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"Every cabin you see, I stacked.  The boulder wall too.  With a forklift it "
"would have taken a month.  The trick isn't lifting them, it's setting them "
"down gently enough that they don't crack.  I cracked a few learning that.  "
"They're in the wall now."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Impressive."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Tomatoes.  In a basement.  In autumn.  You're welcome."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"Lights on at six, lights off at six.  Some people don't respect the "
"schedule."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"Oh!  Hi.  Mind the planters.  If you're new, Constance will want to see you;"
" she's upstairs, through the map room."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "How do plants grow down here?"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"I'm the sun down here.  Twelve hours a day, every day.  It sounds peaceful "
"until you've done it for a month.  The lamps help when I need to sleep, but "
"plants can tell the difference.  So can I, honestly.  The light I make is "
"warmer."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "That's amazing."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"Battery bank's at ninety percent.  You can thank me.  Everybody else forgets"
" to."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"If your flashlight's dead, leave it on the bench downstairs.  I'll get to "
"it.  Eventually."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"Constance runs things.  Office, up the road.  And whatever you've heard "
"about my bed, it works."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "So... about the cage around your bed."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"Go on, ask.  ...Fine.  I discharge in my sleep.  Little arcs, mostly.  The "
"first week I cooked a radio, two phones and Theo's reading glasses, and I "
"don't even know how that last one works.  So: chain-link all round the bed, "
"grounded to a stake in the floor.  It's a Faraday cage.  It works.  Stop "
"smiling."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "I'm not smiling."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Every pin on that wall is something I saw without seeing it."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "The hordes are moving east this week.  Not toward us.  Not yet."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"You came in through the gate and stopped twice to look back.  Sorry.  Habit."
"  Constance is through that door; she'll want to meet you."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "What are the green pins?"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Is there a green pin I could follow up?"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "About that green pin..."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Is anyone else out there who needs finding?"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"People like us, the moment they woke up.  When someone awakens it's loud.  "
"Not to the ears.  Like a flare going up over the trees.  I mark it, and we "
"send someone, because the alternative is they figure it out alone.  We're "
"always short of someone to send."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "I'll keep that in mind."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Off the circle, please.  Thank you.  I'm due in Ohio by noon."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"Brought back canned peaches from somewhere near Albany.  Don't tell Ray."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"Oh!  You're new.  Please don't stand in the circles.  If you're looking for "
"someone in charge, Constance is in the office."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "What's wrong with standing in the circles?"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"The scale's flat, it's clear, and it's steel, so it holds a picture well in "
"my head.  When I come home, I aim for a circle.  If something is in the "
"circle when I land...  Look.  Just don't be in the circle."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Noted."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"Eleven days.  I'd like to make it twelve.  Try not to be the reason it "
"isn't."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"Sit, if you're bleeding.  Stand, if you're not.  The beds are for the "
"bleeding."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"You're hurt, or you're new.  If you're new, Constance is next door, through "
"the map room.  If you're hurt, sit down.  Either way, don't bleed on the "
"floor.  I just mopped."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "You're the doctor?"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"I'm the closest thing.  I knit bone now.  Skin, muscle, the works.  Before "
"all this I was an accountant.  The whiteboard was my idea.  It helps to "
"count something that goes up."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Here's to twelve."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Third breakfast.  Don't judge."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Have you seen the board?  Check the board."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"*keeps eating.*  Boss is in the office.  Constance.  I'd walk you over, but "
"I'm busy."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "What's with the tally board?"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"Biokinetics burn it faster than you'd believe.  My body runs hot; it's "
"rebuilding itself all day long.  Theo and I keep score.  I'm winning this "
"week.  If Theo tells you he's winning, he's lying.  Check the board."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "I'll check the board."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Green Pin"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for mission 'Green Pin'
#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"Wren felt someone awaken.  Find the new psion where she marked your map and "
"bring them back to the quarry, before they have to figure it out alone."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Someone woke up out there."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"There's a new green pin.  Someone awakened in the last day or so, and "
"they're alone, and they're frightened.  I've marked where I felt them.  Will"
" you go and bring them home?"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"Thank you.  Be gentle.  Whatever they can do, they can't control it yet."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "That's all right.  Jules will go when he's back.  If he's back."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"Don't startle them.  If you're one of us, let them feel it; that does more "
"than talking ever will.  If you're not, talk slowly, and keep your hands "
"where they can see them."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Did you find them?"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"You brought them.  I can feel them from here, quieter already.  Thank you.  "
"That's one less person going through this alone."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "No.  I'd feel them if they were here.  Go back."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"I felt it when they went out.  Like a candle.  ...We'll get to the next one "
"sooner."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Newly Awakened Biokinetic"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "I don't know what's happening to me."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Newly Awakened Clairsentient"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Newly Awakened Electrokinetic"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Newly Awakened Photokinetic"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Newly Awakened Pyrokinetic"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Newly Awakened Telekinetic"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Newly Awakened Telepath"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Newly Awakened Teleporter"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Is it much further?"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Do they really all have it?  Whatever this is?"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Sorry if I'm jumpy.  Everything is jumpy."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "I keep waiting to wake up.  I don't think that's how this works."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"Don't look at my arm.  It was broken two hours ago.  It healed wrong.  No, "
"it healed RIGHT, and that's worse."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"I knew you were coming.  I watched you walk up the road an hour ago.  I "
"wasn't there.  How was I not there?"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"Don't touch me.  I mean it.  The last person who touched me went down "
"twitching, and I don't know how to make it stop."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"&The air around them glows faintly, like a lamp left on in daylight.  \"Make"
" it stop.  Please.  They can see me coming from a mile away.\""
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"Stay back!  Everything I touch catches fire.  The grass, my jacket, the... "
"just stay BACK!"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"&A road sign lies bent double beside them, and they are staring at it.  \"I "
"didn't touch that.  I swear I didn't touch it.\""
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"Stop thinking so loud.  Please.  Everyone, everything, it's all so LOUD."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"Where am I?  I was in my kitchen.  I blinked and I was here.  Before that I "
"was on a roof.  I can't stop doing it."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Who are you?  What do you want?"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"*Let a little of your own power show.*  You're not the only one.  There's a "
"place for people like us."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"Wren sent me.  There are others like you, at a quarry not far from here.  "
"They can help."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Let's keep moving."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Never mind."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"...Okay.  Okay.  If there's somewhere I can stop being scared of my own "
"hands, I'll go.  Lead the way."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Stay close."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"I don't know you.  I don't know anything anymore.  Just... give me some "
"time.  Come back later."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "All right."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"*looks around the quarry, at the stone cabins and the smoke from the forge, "
"and lets out a breath they seem to have been holding for days.*  Thank you."
"  I mean it."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Welcome home."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"Here we are.  This is the quarry.  Go and find Constance; she'll find you a "
"bunk."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"Marcus says I can have the next cabin he builds.  I might cry, honestly."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Theo says I'm sleeping better.  I am.  Nobody's afraid of me here."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"Wren's got another pin on the wall.  Better you than me.  ...I mean that "
"kindly."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"Constance asked what I could do, and then she just nodded.  Like it was "
"normal.  Like I was normal."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Glad you're settling in."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "There's always another.  I've marked this one on your map.  Go gently."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "I'm on it."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"Mark it on your map first.  Put a note on the spot, any note, and I'll find "
"it.  But I can't land you on a pin.  You'll come down somewhere within about"
" three map squares of your mark, and I don't get to choose where.  So think "
"about what's inside that circle.  Especially water."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "I've marked it.  Send me."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "What's wrong with water?"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "I'll go mark it first."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"If there's a lake or a river inside three squares of your mark, you might "
"come down in the middle of it, with everything you own on your back.  People"
" don't swim out of that.  If you want to go somewhere near the coast or a "
"river, put the mark inland, a few squares back from the shore, and walk the "
"rest.  I'll warn you if I can feel water out there, but I'd rather you aimed"
" right in the first place."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Understood.  I've marked it.  Send me."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "I'd better move my mark."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Where does it hurt?  Show me."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "*sparks crawl over their knuckles.*  What needs juice?"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Broke something?  Let's see it."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "You look cold.  Everyone always looks cold."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "The basement's doing well.  Hungry?"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Tell me what you're looking for."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Going somewhere?"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "You're thinking very loudly.  Sit down."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "What do you need?"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Can you patch me up?"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "I have a bionic I need put in."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "I want a bionic taken out."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Can you charge my gear?"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Could you fix up my gear?"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "I'm chilled through.  Can you warm me up?"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Anything growing in the basement?"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Could you look for a place for me?"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Can you send me somewhere?"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "My head's a mess.  Can you help?"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Warmed Through"
msgstr ""

#. ~ desc of effect 'mom_psi_warmed'
#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "A pyrokinetic's heat is still in you, keeping the cold out."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Apply message for effect(s) 'Warmed Through'.
#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Warmth spreads through you and stays."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Remove message for effect(s) 'Warmed Through'.
#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "The borrowed warmth finally fades."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Quiet Mind"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"I'd love to.  But I'm one pair of hands for the whole camp, and they're "
"already full.  If you ever find another one like me out there, bring them "
"home.  Then I'd have time to patch you up too."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"Not yet.  All I can see right now is the next pin.  Bring home another "
"clairsentient and the two of us can look a great deal farther.  Then I'll "
"look for whatever you need."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"Every spark I've got goes into the battery bank.  Bring me someone else who "
"can make a current, and I'll have charge to spare for your gear."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"The basement takes everything I have just to keep the tomatoes alive.  Bring"
" home another photokinetic, and there'll be enough to send some with you."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"The forge eats all the heat I can make.  Find me another fire-starter, and "
"I'll have warmth to spare for you."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"I'm holding half this quarry up as it is.  Literally, some days.  Bring home"
" another telekinetic, and I'll start fixing your things too."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"My head is full of everyone here already.  Bring home another telepath, "
"someone to share the noise with, and I'll have room for yours."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"I'm running every supply run there is, alone.  Find another jumper and bring"
" them home.  With help, I could send you places."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Maybe someday."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Where would I find one?"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "I'll keep an eye out."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"That's my job.  Every time someone wakes up out there, I put a green pin on "
"the map and ask somebody to go and get them.  Ask me for the next one.  I "
"can't promise what they'll be, but sooner or later one will be like me."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid ""
"Ask Wren.  Every time someone wakes up out there, she puts a green pin on "
"the map.  You can't choose what they'll be when you find them, but sooner or"
" later one of them will be like me."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "I'll talk to Wren."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_alliance.json
msgid "Then give me a pin."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_civilians.json
msgid "I am the heart of the storm!"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_civilians.json
msgid "&They smile as lightning crackles over their skin."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_civilians.json
msgid "How are you doing that?"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_civilians.json
msgid "*Back away slowly*"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_civilians.json
msgid "I have the power of the storm!  I will save this world!"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_civilians.json
msgid "&They say nothing, merely looking at you with glowing eyes."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_civilians.json
msgid ""
"This isn't real…  It's just tricks right?  Haha.  It's just tricks and "
"lights…"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_civilians.json
msgid "It's not like any tricks I've ever seen…"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_civilians.json
msgid "Hahaha!!  Burn!  BURN!!"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_civilians.json
msgid "&They cackle loudly as flames burst from their outstretched hand."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_civilians.json
msgid "All will burn!"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_civilians.json
msgid "Isn't it beautiful?  BURN THEM ALL!"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_civilians.json
msgid "The flames have chosen me!"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_civilians.json
msgid "Get out of here!"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_civilians.json
msgid "No, no no!  Go away!"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/psi_civilians.json
msgid "*doesn't look at you at all.  They just keep yelling at the horde."
msgstr ""

