#: ./npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
#: ./npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_generic.json
#: ./npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_traitor.json
msgid "…"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid "And?"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid "Yeah, it is what it is."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid "Those storms at the end of world…  I was fine before them."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid "You noticed, did you?"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, I've had it for years at this point.  Not much I can do about it now, "
"though."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid "Really wish I had gotten some more treatment before, you know."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid "I can cure your illness for you."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid "We'll talk about that after you're done operating that vehicle."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid "I don't want to talk about that while I'm operating a vehicle!"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid "I'm too thirsty, give me something to drink."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid "I'm too hungry, give me something to eat."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid "I'm too tired, let me rest first."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid "I already told you no.  Let it go."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid "I have some reason to refuse healing."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid "Ah, okay."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid "* coughs.  \"Yeah, I'm not feeling so great"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid "No.  No I don't."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid "Yeah, I think I'm coming down with something."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid "Ugh, yeah.  If only I could call in sick, you know?"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid "I can cure it for you."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid "They just itch like crazy at all time lately."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid "Yeah, I guess.  Must have got something in them."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid "You're going to what?  How are you going to do that?"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"You've seen what I can do, right?  Let me try.  (Note: By doing this you "
"will absorb their disease into yourself.)"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid "Never mind then."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid "Forget it, let's get going."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"I don't think so.  I know there are zombies out there and the world is all "
"fucked up, but I'd rather keep that fucked-up-ness as far away from me as "
"possible.  No offense."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid "Alright, if you insist."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid "Alright, it can't be worse than what I'm already going through."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid "Sure, I'll try anything at this point."
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Okay.  The medicine's going to run out someday and then I'll really be "
"fucked.  If this works…"
msgstr ""

#: ./npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid "Yeah, I feel awful.  What have I got to lose?"
msgstr ""

